        <item>
            <title>0.1.2</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 13:08:59 +0800</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>3</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description xml:lang="zh-Hans"><![CDATA[<h3>新增</h3>
<ul><li>智能分类设置新增「打开控制台」，可在浏览器中管理 API Key 和账单</li></ul>
<h3>改进</h3>
<ul><li>精简设置页：已有条目的分类操作收成一行，检查更新移到版本号旁</li><li>默认开启自动检查更新，可在「通用」设置中关闭</li></ul>
<h3>修复</h3>
<ul><li>智能分类的「高级」现在点整行都能展开收起</li><li>剪贴板图片在列表和存储空间页不再显示空名称</li></ul>]]></description>
            <description xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[<h3>Added</h3>
<ul><li>Added Open Console to Smart Categories settings for managing API keys and billing</li></ul>
<h3>Changed</h3>
<ul><li>Tidied Settings: existing-item actions fit on one row and Check for Updates sits beside the version</li><li>Update checks are now on by default and can be turned off in General settings</li></ul>
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul><li>Advanced in Smart Categories settings now expands when you click anywhere on its row</li><li>Clipboard images no longer appear with a blank name in lists and Storage</li></ul>]]></description>
